s/#H318"}, {"Start": 41, "Length": 6, "Type": "Color", "Extra": "GHSDanger"}]}, {"String": "H335 (44.3%): May cause respiratory irritation [Warning Specific target organ toxicity, single exposure; Respiratory tract irritation]", "Markup": [{"Start": 0, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#H335"}, {"Start": 48, "Length": 7, "Type": "Color", "Extra": "GHSWarning"}]}, {"String": "H400 (99.4%): Very toxic to aquatic life [Warning Hazardous to the aquatic environment, acute hazard]", "Markup": [{"Start": 0, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#H400"}, {"Start": 42, "Length": 7, "Type": "Color", "Extra": "GHSWarning"}]}, {"String": "H410 (40.9%): Very toxic to aquatic life with long lasting effects [Warning Hazardous to the aquatic environment, long-term hazard]", "Markup": [{"Start": 0, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#H410"}, {"Start": 68, "Length": 7, "Type": "Color", "Extra": "GHSWarning"}]}]}}, {"ReferenceNumber": 20, "Name": "Precautionary Statement Codes", "Value": {"StringWithMarkup": [{"String": "P260, P261, P262, P264, P264+P265, P270, P271, P273, P280, P301+P317, P301+P330+P331, P302+P352, P302+P361+P354, P304+P340, P305+P354+P338, P316, P317, P319, P321, P330, P332+P317, P361+P364, P362+P364, P363, P391, P403+P233, P405, and P501 (click each P-code to see the statement)", "Markup": [{"Start": 0, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#P260"}, {"Start": 6, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#P261"}, {"Start": 12, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#P262"}, {"Start": 18, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#P264"}, {"Start": 24, "Length": 9, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#P264+P265"}, {"Start": 35, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#P270"}, {"Start": 41, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/ghs/#P271"}, {"Start": 47, "Length": 4, "URL": "https://pubchem